WEBVTT

00:01:36.870 --> 00:01:39.530
We've set sail onto the open seas
on a journey to the outer world...

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:42.700
...and picked up Filia, a priestess of
the Fire Dragon King, along the way.

00:01:42.770 --> 00:01:44.870
Huh?! You've made a guess...

00:01:44.940 --> 00:01:47.310
...that I'm supposed to
save the world from danger?!

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:50.140
Look, that's the craziest
thing I've ever heard!

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:52.410
Hmm... Well, I don't know
quite what's going on here...

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:55.320
...but if you say so,
then I guess I'll take the job!

00:02:03.460 --> 00:02:04.290
So?

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:10.400
Where's this big threat to the
world you said was coming?

00:02:10.470 --> 00:02:12.330
Yeah, really!

00:02:12.600 --> 00:02:16.730
The food in this town is great,
and it's so peaceful here!

00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:18.430
No kidding!

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:23.010
Just listening to
the waves like this...

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:25.480
...seems to cleanse me
all the way into my heart.

00:02:26.180 --> 00:02:28.210
What a lovely sea...

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:42.260
But there's no doubting the
Fire Dragon King's prophecy!

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:44.700
It's a fact that a threat
to the world is coming!

00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:50.610
And what is it, Filia? We sort
of believe your prophecy...

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:53.400
...but can't you give more details of
what's going to happen and when?!

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:57.550
I can't. Prophecies aren't
weather forecasts!

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:01.140
They don't give detailed
descriptions of where and what!

00:03:02.250 --> 00:03:03.850
I see...

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:08.620
Hm? Where are you going, Zel?

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:13.330
My objective is to find a way to
turn my body back to normal.

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:15.330
That's why I came
to the outer world.

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:17.990
I didn't come to get caught
up in some stupid trouble.

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:20.160
Sorry about this.

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:21.600
You can't!

00:03:21.670 --> 00:03:23.770
Oh, Zel always does this.

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:31.370
Anyway, our bellies are all
filled, so it's time for us...

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:34.580
To go to the temple
of the Fire Dragon King?!

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:39.320
...to find this kingdom's
specialty foods!

00:03:39.390 --> 00:03:40.790
All right!

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:45.130
Specialty foods?
At a time like this?

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:50.890
What shall I eat, oh what to eat?

00:03:50.970 --> 00:03:53.560
Lina, shouldn't we find
a dessert place first?

00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:55.630
Good idea!
Let's go! Let's go!

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:02.710
They're not taking
this seriously at all!

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:07.180
Don't they understand
how serious this is?!

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:11.880
Well, that's how Miss Lina
and the others always act.

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:14.750
Isn't it peaceful?

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:18.180
As long as I see
the town like this...

00:04:18.260 --> 00:04:22.760
...I just can't imagine there's a
threat approaching this world.

00:04:25.400 --> 00:04:29.360
Miss Lina and Mr. Zelgadis
went off somewhere.

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:33.270
What am I going to do?
Of course!

00:04:33.610 --> 00:04:36.210
That's the ticket!
Let's do it!

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:40.740
I hope nothing happens
while all this is going on.

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:45.550
Oh... I have such a bad
feeling about all this.

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:04.810
Anybody who doesn't wanna
die better clear out!

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:07.940
All this village's treasure
belongs to the boss!

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:10.380
Take this!

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:37.900
I hear this village has a weird sword
that it's had for ages, right?

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:39.970
Hand it over now,
nice and easy!

00:05:43.350 --> 00:05:45.540
Speak in words I can
actually understand!

00:05:45.850 --> 00:05:51.450
Legendary sword... Guardian god...
Protects peace of this land!

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:53.250
Cannot give to you!

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:55.620
Guardian god?

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:58.960
So, we found something
that important, huh?

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:01.830
Show me where it is!

00:06:12.710 --> 00:06:17.700
At a time like this, you visit
all the high spots in a kingdom!

00:06:17.780 --> 00:06:19.910
Yeah! This is great! Just great!

00:06:21.320 --> 00:06:24.780
"A girl who has Justice
there on her side..."

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:28.450
"...never has to fear
what evil has in store!"

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:30.720
"Go, go, mighty hero..."

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:31.950
Hey! Look out!

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:33.690
Is that a young girl up there?!

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:35.960
Hey! Don't do anything rash!

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:43.160
What was that, everyone?
I can't hear you!

00:06:48.110 --> 00:06:50.010
I wonder what's got
them all so excited.

00:06:50.650 --> 00:06:54.580
I'm telling you,
young people these days!

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:04.760
Oh, no! Levitation!

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:08.690
AGH! She's doomed!

00:07:19.110 --> 00:07:21.810
Wh- What are you?!

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:25.870
Are you all right?
Here, give me your hand.

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:29.080
Wh-Wh-What are you doing?!

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:30.620
Recovery!

00:07:36.730 --> 00:07:38.350
Huh? What in the world?

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:42.630
There! You should
be all better now, ma'am.

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:48.100
Oh, thank you so much!
Thank you!

00:07:48.170 --> 00:07:49.330
An angel!

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:52.430
She's an angel, sent from
heaven above to us!

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:55.440
Huh? An angel?

00:07:56.810 --> 00:07:59.680
Um, excuse me. Excuse me!

00:08:10.390 --> 00:08:11.380
Lighting!

00:08:12.060 --> 00:08:13.290
Co-o-o-ol!

00:08:24.740 --> 00:08:26.000
Excuse me.

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:30.980
The unopenable temple has been
closed off for centuries.

00:08:31.050 --> 00:08:32.850
You cannot enter there!

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:37.650
Unopenable temple?
Just what I was looking for.

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:40.880
Hey! I'm telling you,
it's useless!

00:08:41.390 --> 00:08:43.020
Damu Bras!

00:08:57.880 --> 00:08:59.140
Just rubble...

00:08:59.380 --> 00:09:00.070
Hey!

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:02.010
Y-Y-Y-Y-Yes, sir?

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:04.170
Aren't there any other
big temples around here?

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:09.580
Yes, sir! I'll show you them at once!
Just spare my life, please!

00:09:11.220 --> 00:09:14.850
Okay, fine. Please, lead on.

00:09:31.740 --> 00:09:34.470
No help here, either.
Hey! Next one?

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:40.540
This is the last one! There aren't
any other temples in this town!

00:09:40.620 --> 00:09:43.350
Oh, well. I guess we'll have to
start hitting the libraries now.

00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:48.180
You are completely surrounded!

00:09:48.260 --> 00:09:50.420
We will not permit this
lawlessness to continue!

00:09:50.490 --> 00:09:52.520
You heartless
sorcerer-swordsman!

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:55.350
You heartless
sorcerer-swordsman!

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:00.930
I like the sound of that.

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:05.900
You see? Keep a love of
Justice in your hearts!

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:09.910
With passion and courage,
you all can make miracles happen!

00:10:10.450 --> 00:10:13.250
There is nothing
thatJustice can't do!

00:10:17.790 --> 00:10:20.220
Trouble! Trouble!

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:22.920
A demon is attacking the town!

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:24.120
A demon?!

00:10:28.430 --> 00:10:29.360
Very well!

00:10:30.530 --> 00:10:32.300
With the power of love
which comes from Justice...

00:10:32.870 --> 00:10:36.240
...watch me... as I
vanquish this threat!

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:43.440
I don't get this!

00:10:43.510 --> 00:10:47.110
This place doesn't have that
many unusual foods at all!

00:10:47.180 --> 00:10:51.380
Still, you gotta love these sea ports.
Freshest food under the sun!

00:10:51.820 --> 00:10:55.520
Well, that's true, but...
Huh? What's that?

00:10:55.860 --> 00:10:57.160
A demon!

00:10:58.700 --> 00:11:01.030
The angel's gonna
fight the demon!

00:11:01.230 --> 00:11:03.060
It's the battle
of the century!

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:10.970
How did this happen?

00:11:15.680 --> 00:11:18.080
Sorry.
Got a little carried away.

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:26.950
For heaven's sake!

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:33.330
Can't you just...

00:11:35.730 --> 00:11:39.430
...CUT IT OUT?!!!

00:11:39.640 --> 00:11:41.230
Oh! Mr. Zelgadis!

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:53.080
Um, Filia? Hold on here...

00:12:11.840 --> 00:12:14.170
For heaven's sake,
it's one thing after another!

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:17.070
When are you all going
to start acting seriously...

00:12:17.140 --> 00:12:19.870
...and set out for the temple
of the Fire Dragon King?!

00:12:21.110 --> 00:12:23.510
C'mon, don't get so excited.

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:27.580
After all, we said we'd agree
to take your job, right?

00:12:27.790 --> 00:12:30.690
Exactly! And you didn't have
to go that far before!

00:12:32.290 --> 00:12:33.720
No fair.

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:35.690
It's only what you deserve!

00:12:37.430 --> 00:12:42.230
But how did you cause such a ruckus
from just walking around town?

00:12:43.470 --> 00:12:44.600
Magic!

00:12:44.670 --> 00:12:48.000
Yeah... These people here
seem to be having...

00:12:48.070 --> 00:12:50.470
...an unusual reaction
to the magic we use.

00:12:50.840 --> 00:12:52.780
Well, that's hardly surprising.

00:12:53.450 --> 00:12:54.710
Why? Why is that?

00:12:55.780 --> 00:13:00.310
The people here have never
seen magic like yours.

00:13:02.020 --> 00:13:04.320
The unusually high development
of magic you know...

00:13:04.390 --> 00:13:08.350
...was limited to your kingdoms
within the Monster race's barrier.

00:13:08.490 --> 00:13:10.660
Huh? So, you're saying?

00:13:10.730 --> 00:13:14.130
Yes. The ones they call
sorcerers in these parts...

00:13:14.200 --> 00:13:18.640
...can only handle spells
like lighting and sleeping.

00:13:18.700 --> 00:13:19.640
Whoa...

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:23.310
So, by coming
to the outer world...

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:26.830
...we're all now
unbeatable heroes!

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:28.710
Emphasis on the
"hero" part, I hope.

00:13:29.880 --> 00:13:34.440
Anyway, I'm sick of standing
out like some kind of monster.

00:13:34.720 --> 00:13:36.520
Let's get out of this town
as soon as we can!

00:13:37.720 --> 00:13:40.920
Oh? You mean you're
finally ready? Thank goodness!

00:13:40.990 --> 00:13:42.980
In that case, let's get going!

00:13:43.060 --> 00:13:44.320
Whoa! Zel?

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:47.060
Go on, Mr. Gourry!
Hurry along now!

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:48.760
You don't have to shove!

00:13:48.830 --> 00:13:50.830
Oh, well.

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:57.070
Okay. Low profile...

00:13:59.710 --> 00:14:03.440
Oh, man. I was getting
to like this port, too.

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:08.150
Well, maybe the next town
will be even more fun.

00:14:08.290 --> 00:14:09.980
They might have good food, too.

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:11.710
You think they will?

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:13.220
Sure they will!
It'll be great!

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:16.950
What... What is that?

00:14:22.030 --> 00:14:24.090
What's wrong, Filia?

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:28.030
Nothing... I just suddenly
sensed some nameless evil.

00:14:28.110 --> 00:14:30.200
Is it a new prophecy?

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:31.900
No, it isn't that!

00:14:31.980 --> 00:14:36.510
It's as though I'm suddenly
filled with anger for no reason!

00:14:49.530 --> 00:14:51.460
No one saw, right?

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:53.230
No, I'm pretty sure they saw it.

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:56.220
Staring at me.
Always staring at me!

00:14:56.300 --> 00:14:58.930
I know! I know! Calm down!

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:03.660
Right, right. Nothing to see here!
Don't bother yourselves with it!

00:15:03.740 --> 00:15:05.040
Home's that-a-way!

00:15:07.480 --> 00:15:08.710
That's!

00:15:08.780 --> 00:15:11.980
Wha... Hey! Miss Lina, wait!

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:21.860
That was... Could it be?!

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:26.320
Oh, there she is!

00:15:26.470 --> 00:15:27.990
Hey! Lina!

00:15:28.930 --> 00:15:30.900
What happened, Miss Lina?

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:36.410
I think a REAL demon may
have actually shown up.

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:41.310
One we haven't seen in a while.

00:15:58.400 --> 00:16:01.390
So, this is the
legendary sword, huh?

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:02.630
Well...

00:16:12.140 --> 00:16:14.110
Should I try a bomb, Boss?

00:16:14.180 --> 00:16:15.650
No, you idiot!

00:16:15.710 --> 00:16:20.120
If we damage it, Lord Valgaav
will have our hides!

00:16:20.350 --> 00:16:24.380
You just... leave this to me!

00:16:30.060 --> 00:16:31.430
Go for it, Boss!

00:16:33.870 --> 00:16:37.030
Terrible thing will happen...

00:16:41.970 --> 00:16:43.310
The Holy Sword...

00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:47.610
You're saying that is the
final weapon we seek?

00:16:47.680 --> 00:16:49.110
There's no positive proof...

00:16:49.180 --> 00:16:51.810
...but at the moment we
have no other leads.

00:16:51.880 --> 00:16:54.080
Our searches turned it up.

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:59.110
In the meantime, I shall take
Gorun Nova, the Sword of Light.

00:16:59.460 --> 00:17:01.450
So, the hour you've
awaited is at hand.

00:17:02.390 --> 00:17:03.730
They have come.

00:17:03.800 --> 00:17:07.700
Those who possess Gorun Nova
have appeared before us.

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:10.560
There is no need to
hold back any longer.

00:17:10.640 --> 00:17:12.330
Now go and reclaim it!

00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:13.370
As you wish, sir...

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:15.600
Don't slip up.

00:17:15.940 --> 00:17:17.030
Of course I won't!

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:22.980
You think you can escape?!
Do you, Lina Inverse?!

00:17:24.920 --> 00:17:27.150
What?! You saw Xellos?!

00:17:28.420 --> 00:17:31.010
I think... It had to be him.

00:17:31.090 --> 00:17:33.580
I'm sure he was coming towards us
as we were coming out of the town.

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:37.800
But it's not like Xellos
doesn't know us.

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:38.960
Why would he vanish like that?

00:17:39.430 --> 00:17:42.090
I have a feeling
that Filia's prophecy...

00:17:42.170 --> 00:17:45.160
...and Xellos's
appearance are connected.

00:17:46.470 --> 00:17:49.460
Miss Lina, you mean...
Are you saying?

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:54.070
Yeah. I think the Monster race
may be involved in this thing, too.

00:17:55.280 --> 00:17:59.010
I'm more inclined to
believe in the prophecy now.

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:00.050
What do you think, Filia?

00:18:02.990 --> 00:18:05.620
A Monster... A Monster?!

00:18:05.690 --> 00:18:09.490
A Monster?
A Monster's involved?!

00:18:10.960 --> 00:18:12.620
Um, excuse me. Filia?

00:18:13.600 --> 00:18:16.570
Where are you, Monster?!

00:18:17.840 --> 00:18:19.500
Look out!

00:18:27.650 --> 00:18:28.640
What was that all about?!

00:18:30.620 --> 00:18:32.280
Oh! Miss Lina! Look!

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:37.750
Don't tell me!
It really IS a Monster?!

00:18:37.820 --> 00:18:38.880
In a way.

00:18:45.030 --> 00:18:48.090
We finally meet, Lina Inverse!

00:18:48.170 --> 00:18:49.830
I've waited so long for this!

00:18:50.070 --> 00:18:55.900
Oh? You mean my name's spread
all the way out to this world?

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:59.940
I see. You're as much of a
smart-aleck as I've heard.

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:02.240
How was a little witch like you...

00:19:02.310 --> 00:19:03.980
...able to defeat the
Demon Dragon King?

00:19:04.650 --> 00:19:07.640
Demon Dragon King?!
Who are you?!

00:19:08.220 --> 00:19:10.480
Who am I? Who indeed.

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:14.860
Instead of an introduction,
I'll give you THIS!

00:19:24.170 --> 00:19:25.330
This power!

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:33.310
Could he be one of Demon
Dragon King Gaav's?!

00:19:34.710 --> 00:19:38.380
Correct. My name is Valgaav.

00:19:38.450 --> 00:19:41.910
One of the proud Monsters
who served Lord Gaav.

00:19:42.250 --> 00:19:44.520
Wh- What?!

00:19:44.590 --> 00:19:47.820
The enemy Miss Lina couldn't
defeat, even with the Ragna Blade!

00:19:47.890 --> 00:19:49.690
Gaav, the Demon Dragon King!

00:19:50.530 --> 00:19:53.050
Bring back memories?
At the very least...

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:56.100
...this power is beyond
any that you know!

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:58.940
Why are you doing this to us?!

00:19:59.370 --> 00:20:01.070
You know very well why!

00:20:01.140 --> 00:20:03.630
So that you can know the
anguish Lord Gaav felt!

00:20:03.710 --> 00:20:06.800
Lina Inverse! I shall kill you!

00:20:07.210 --> 00:20:08.650
Uh-oh! Amelia! Zel!

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:11.270
Protection barrier!

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:12.340
Right!

00:20:12.420 --> 00:20:13.440
Right!

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:23.960
Miss Lina, it's not going to hold!

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:28.660
First Xellos shows up, and now THIS!
What's going on here?!

00:20:28.770 --> 00:20:31.600
And why's this happening to
us here in the outer world?

00:20:38.610 --> 00:20:40.440
One minute we're in
a nice, peaceful town...

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:42.880
...and now we've walked
straight into a desert hell!

00:20:42.950 --> 00:20:46.350
This may not be a threat to the
world, but it's sure a threat to US!

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:49.780
And where's Xellos
when we need him?!

00:20:53.590 --> 00:20:56.530
It seems the players
are now all in place...

00:22:23.180 --> 00:22:26.810
What's with this guy?! You'd think
he has a personal grudge against me!

00:22:26.890 --> 00:22:28.610
Huh? He does?

00:22:28.890 --> 00:22:32.410
Next time: " On the Move!
He's Out for Revenge?"

00:22:32.490 --> 00:22:35.290
You better watch, or else
I'll REALLY cause some trouble!
